{"h":"rocky-boot-rkw0468-w","t":"Rocky Men's Ironhawk Composite Toe Western Boots (RKW0468 W - Brown)","b":"Rocky","c":"Boots","d":"Details \n The Rocky IronHawk is built for the tough, no-nonsense man who demands durability and strength. Crafted from waterproof full-grain leather and reinforced with triple-stitched rubber toe and heel guards, this 12\" boot stands up to abrasions and harsh environments. The oil- and slip-resisting high-abrasion rubber outsole, paired with a lightweight EVA midsole, ensures stability on unpredictable terrain. Keep your feet dry and energized with guaranteed Rocky\u00ae Recycled Waterproof construction and our Rocky\u00ae Air-Port Lite\u00ae sponge PU footbed with memory foam. This boot meets ASTM F2413 protective toe and electrical hazard standards for guaranteed protection on the job site.\n- Triple-Stitched Rubber Toe & Heel Guards\n- 12 Inches in height\n- Expansion Fit Seam for easy on and off\n- Flex Welt Construction\n- Waterproof Full Grain Leather\n- Fancy Stitch Shaft\n- Rocky\u00ae Air-Port Lite\u00ae Sponge PU Footbed with Memory Foam\n- Decorative Toe Bug\n- Square toe\n- ASTM F2413 protective toe classification\n- ASTM F2413 electrical hazard standard\n- Oil- & Slip-Resisting High-Abrasion Rubber Outsole\n- Guaranteed Rocky\u00ae Recycled Waterproof Construction","tags":["Men / Man / Hombre / Caballero"],"imgs":["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0466/0428/8151/files/rocky_gunsmokewppullon_men_rkw0468_profile_22652.jpg","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0466/0428/8151/files/rocky_gunsmokewppullon_men_rkw0468_singlequarter_22650.jpg","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0466/0428/8151/files/rocky_gunsmokewppullon_men_rkw0468_profileleft_22654.jpg","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0466/0428/8151/files/rocky_gunsmokewppullon_men_rkw0468_outsole_22657.jpg","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0466/0428/8151/files/rocky_gunsmokewppullon_men_rkw0468_doublequarter_22648.jpg","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0466/0428/8151/fil